# Never let real secrets or dev-only files into a build context that gets
# COPY . .'d into a builder-stage image layer (cmd/api/Dockerfile,
# cmd/worker/Dockerfile) — that layer persists in the local build cache and
# any exported/imported CI cache even though the final runtime stage only
# copies out the compiled binary.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.claude/
*.md

# Test artifacts / local tooling, irrelevant to the compiled binary
*.log
coverage.out
